{"seq":4,"slug":"actions-optimization","title":"Actions 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/actions-optimization","wordCount":797,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"actions-性能优化\">Actions 性能优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GitHub Actions 的性能直接影响开发者体验和 CI 成本。每分钟的 Runner 时间都是真金白银——GitHub-hosted Runner 按分钟计费，自托管 Runner 则消耗基础设施资源。优化的目标是<strong>在不牺牲质量门禁的前提下，将工作流执行时间压缩到最短</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能优化策略] --&gt; B[缓存优化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[并行化]&#10;    A --&gt; D[按需执行]&#10;    A --&gt; E[资源优化]&#10;    B --&gt; F[依赖缓存]&#10;    B --&gt; G[构建缓存]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Job 并行]&#10;    C --&gt; I[矩阵拆分]&#10;    D --&gt; J[路径过滤]&#10;    D --&gt; K[变更检测]&#10;    E --&gt; L[Runner 选择]&#10;    E --&gt; M[镜像优化]\">graph TD\n    A[性能优化策略] --&gt; B[缓存优化]\n    A --&gt; C[并行化]\n    A --&gt; D[按需执行]\n    A --&gt; E[资源优化]\n    B --&gt; F[依赖缓存]\n    B --&gt; G[构建缓存]\n    C --&gt; H[Job 并行]\n    C --&gt; I[矩阵拆分]\n    D --&gt; J[路径过滤]\n    D --&gt; K[变更检测]\n    E --&gt; L[Runner 选择]\n    E --&gt; M[镜像优化]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>预期收益</th>\n<th>实施复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖缓存</td>\n<td>节省 30-50%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建缓存（Turborepo）</td>\n<td>节省 50-90%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Job 并行化</td>\n<td>节省 30-60%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>独立测试套件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径过滤</td>\n<td>节省 60-80%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Monorepo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自托管 Runner</td>\n<td>节省 40-70%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大规模 CI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker 层缓存</td>\n<td>节省 50-80%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>容器化项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多层缓存策略\">多层缓存策略</h2><p>缓存是性能优化中 ROI 最高的手段。GitHub Actions 提供了 <code>actions/cache</code> 和 <code>actions/setup-*</code> 内置的缓存机制。关键是设计<strong>多层缓存</strong>：精确命中 → 前缀回退 → 冷启动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Cache pnpm store&#10;  uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  id: pnpm-cache&#10;  with:&#10;    path: |&#10;      ~/.local/share/pnpm/store&#10;      node_modules/.cache&#10;    key: pnpm-${{ runner.os }}-${{ hashFiles(&#39;pnpm-lock.yaml&#39;) }}&#10;    restore-keys: |&#10;      pnpm-${{ runner.os }}-&#10;&#10;- name: Cache Turborepo&#10;  uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    path: .turbo&#10;    key: turbo-${{ runner.os }}-${{ github.sha }}&#10;    restore-keys: |&#10;      turbo-${{ runner.os }}-${{ github.base_ref || &#39;main&#39; }}-&#10;      turbo-${{ runner.os }}-\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Cache pnpm store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm-cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      ~/.local/share/pnpm/store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      node_modules/.cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm-${{ runner.os }}-${{ hashFiles('pnpm-lock.yaml') }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      pnpm-${{ runner.os }}-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Cache Turborepo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.turbo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">turbo-${{ runner.os }}-${{ github.sha }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restore-keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      turbo-${{ runner.os }}-${{ github.base_ref || 'main' }}-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      turbo-${{ runner.os }}-</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CacheLayer {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  paths: string[];&#10;  keyTemplate: string;&#10;  restoreKeys: string[];&#10;  hitRate: string;&#10;  savedTime: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const cacheStack: CacheLayer[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;pnpm-store&#39;,&#10;    paths: [&#39;~/.local/share/pnpm/store&#39;],&#10;    keyTemplate: &#39;pnpm-{os}-{lockfileHash}&#39;,&#10;    restoreKeys: [&#39;pnpm-{os}-&#39;],&#10;    hitRate: &#39;85-95%&#39;,&#10;    savedTime: &#39;1-3 min&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;turbo-cache&#39;,&#10;    paths: [&#39;.turbo&#39;],&#10;    keyTemplate: &#39;turbo-{os}-{sha}&#39;,&#10;    restoreKeys: [&#39;turbo-{os}-{baseBranch}-&#39;, &#39;turbo-{os}-&#39;],&#10;    hitRate: &#39;70-90%&#39;,&#10;    savedTime: &#39;3-10 min&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;docker-layers&#39;,&#10;    paths: [&#39;/tmp/.buildx-cache&#39;],&#10;    keyTemplate: &#39;docker-{os}-{dockerfileHash}&#39;,&#10;    restoreKeys: [&#39;docker-{os}-&#39;],&#10;    hitRate: &#39;60-80%&#39;,&#10;    savedTime: &#39;2-5 min&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paths</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  keyTemplate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  restoreKeys</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  savedTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cacheStack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm-store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    paths: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'~/.local/share/pnpm/store'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    keyTemplate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm-{os}-{lockfileHash}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    restoreKeys: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm-{os}-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hitRate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'85-95%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    savedTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1-3 min'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'turbo-cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    paths: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.turbo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    keyTemplate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'turbo-{os}-{sha}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    restoreKeys: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'turbo-{os}-{baseBranch}-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'turbo-{os}-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hitRate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'70-90%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    savedTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3-10 min'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docker-layers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    paths: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/tmp/.buildx-cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    keyTemplate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docker-{os}-{dockerfileHash}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    restoreKeys: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'docker-{os}-'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    hitRate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60-80%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    savedTime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2-5 min'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缓存的最大限制是 <strong>10GB 总容量</strong>（所有分支共享），超过后按最近最少使用（LRU）淘汰。关键是控制缓存大小——对于 <code>node_modules</code>，缓存 pnpm store 而不是 <code>node_modules</code> 本身，因为 store 是内容寻址的、跨项目共享的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"job-拆分与并行化\">Job 拆分与并行化</h2><p>将大 Job 拆分为多个并行 Job 是最直接的加速手段。关键原则是识别<strong>无依赖关系的任务</strong>，让它们同时执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm run lint&#10;&#10;  typecheck:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm -r typecheck&#10;&#10;  test-unit:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        shard: [1, 2, 3, 4]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm vitest --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/4&#10;&#10;  test-e2e:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        browser: [chromium, firefox]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm playwright test --project=${{ matrix.browser }}&#10;&#10;  build:&#10;    needs: [lint, typecheck]&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./.github/actions/setup-pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></s